       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it would be a serious overdose.\n\n- Acetaminophen 3000 mg three times daily comes to **9,000 mg/day**. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day.\n- A single 3000 mg dose is also well above the usual 500\u20131000 mg per dose.\n- At 9 g/day, the risk of hepatotoxicity is high, even with normal liver function.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day)\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day)\n- **3000 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it. If you really do want the original order, tell me that explicitly and I'll go from there. I'd still recommend confirming it with pharmacy first."
